<description>&lt;p&gt;An illegal gold mine in southwest Colombia collapsed, killing 14 miners and injuring 7. A Colombian judge ordered protection of historical artifacts after a museum purge sparked protests, during which security forces used water cannons on demonstrators in Bogotá. The government is preparing a decree to define maritime boundaries for the San Andres, Providencia and Santa Catalina Archipelago while former rebel leaders face war crimes charges related to Indigenous groups. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Times Now&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;TRT World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQYUt3cVgtTTVvYXNjTTRTMkZxaE9qeHJrOWVkSUJtd3VKSkxIRGFmMnM5TWVva1pQYURSSU1feWI0bEJQSHFQWVNYTzFNSGdYMUtJM3M5c1FTWTc2R1hldU50SHFWeTlUa09uTzk1a3hTUkVXcjAzQUw2R3lPSXA3OW1OZWtQUHVzZEpHUkMybTFzZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Seymour Telegraph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NDTV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPMkRBb3FoUUhfamptbE91RllkN2JrZFRjQ2Y0b256ZEtrUmw4eUxsMktXS1J4ZzNESS1qTVI0dzNnX2o5a0xyYWFzWlBIbnR4TkY4a1VjN1IwVEJhNFB3OWlBV2h4ei1oRHUxZ0gxQ0dzM3NSZGxZMmRRZlZ1YVVqZUhEMHl1ME9qZmh2eXJNdjFTejZFWFlIckdENjBsZW9GdVJNLVJmZ3ZpT2phQWJnbzJpT0ZicTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Geo News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQbENYUlg0VWEwX054aVVLeVRINWFhbWFwX21fQkRLaHVXUHNyVW1ZLUwxWml2MzJTaWIyaVZ1